  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:shuvah_yisrael_ad">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/1"/>O Israel, return
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/2"/>unto Adonoy, your God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/3"/>for you have stumbled in your iniquity.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/4"/>Adonoy, do not rebuke us with Your anger,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/5"/>nor chastise us with Your rage.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/6"/>We are sunk in muddy depths [of sin]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/7"/>without a foothold,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/8"/>we have come into deep waters
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/9"/>and the whirlpool has swept us away.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/10"/>Cause us to return to You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/11"/>and we shall return;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_yisrael_ad/12"/>renew our days as of old.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
